  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Culinary Input**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the \"Cooking Branch.\" Specifically, I\'m fleshing out the requirements for a rapid input system. I envision a combined text box and voice recording input area to quickly capture cooking plans. The example I have in mind is: \"Preparing tofu stir-fry and quinoa.\"\n\n\n**Analyzing Ingredient Decomposition**\n\nI\'ve moved on to analyzing ingredients. My focus is on breaking down cooking plans into easily managed ingredient units. I\'m aiming for rapid status updates: \"In Stock\" with slot/quantity, or \"Out of Stock\" that automatically adds an item to the shopping list with a direct button.\n\n\n**Developing Inventory Integration**\n\nI\'m now integrating an inventory status system, considering states like IN_STOCK, LOW, and EMPTY. I\'m aiming for detailed history logging and success banners. The next step is exploring an AI-assisted cooking plan analyzer using `/api/engine/process` or client-side inventory matching, using Gemini as a fallback. I plan to build a smart decomposition engine in `src/components/CookingBranchView.tsx`.\nI\'m including speech recognition and fast preset buttons for common dishes. I will match these against the inventory, decomposing recipes into units.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 17
      nanos: 501552923
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
